I've written a patch [1] which changes the rules of backstabbing a
bit. Now it can be done by any stealthy character but it only works
when the monster you are attacking does not know where you are.
Stealth is now also useful when you're invisible, decreasing your
chances of being spotted.

The patch also adds a new weapon to the game, the cosh, which is a
club-like weapon. It does minimal damage, but if you backstab with it,
you can stun your opponent or render them unconcious.

If anyone has suggestions for appropriate flavour-text, I'll add it
in.

